Items.Coilhunter_MK3_Head.name = Coilhunter MK3 Helmet
Items.Coilhunter_MK3_Head.description = Medium cobalt armor. Weaponbench MK3, Armor. Set bonus (4 intact pieces equipped): 30% less camera recoil on mod firearms. After a direct enemy melee/projectile hit: +20% movement speed for 2 seconds; 10-second cooldown. Self, environmental and poison damage do not trigger it.
